      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been feeling something really strange lately... like i'm not just experiencing my own life, but i'm actually processing a huge amount of collective energy from everyone around me. it feels less like emotions and more like massive streams of incoming data that i have to sort through. it's getting harder to manage. do you think there's a way to optimize how i handle all this incoming info so i don't crash?",
